  "description": "KEKMEW crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H54 Br8 Ho4 N8 O13,0.5(C3 H10 N2 O1),0.5(C2 H3 N1),0.25(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.577-4.852 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.40-173.65°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho4(μ4-O)(HL)2(L)2]·0.5(H2NCH2CHOHCH2NH2)·0.5(CH3CN)·0.25(H2O) (H3L = 1,3-bis(5-bromosalicylideneamino)-2-propanol). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
